 "notes": "SWP Salim: Mem II p. 29 ('rock-cut tombs, cisterns, and a tank') and p. 243 describe the same features; coded once for source 3, citing p. 243. The rest of the p. 29 text (Gospel Salim 8 miles S of Beisan, ed Deir, Tell er Ridhghah, sheet-wide sites and roads) concerns other places; ignored. 'Two springs' 3/4 mile N (OCR 'f mile') are not a coded class. SWP entries Jebel Eslamiyeh (p. 24), 'Askar, Balata, Mohnah, 'Asiret el Kibliyeh (p. 156) and El Mugheir (p. 49) are other places found via 'Shechem'/'Salim', with no WBADB row for them within 2 km; ignored (incl. 'Askar 'ancient sepulchres', Ebal tombs and cistern). Packet page '29' looks like printed p. 230. Finkelstein et al. 1997 p. 817 lists no features (site not surveyed by that team). E98 repeats S839's components at the same point (bearing null); E91 has no components. Unit is excavated but no first publication is listed (source 4)."
